  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Celebrating",
     "texto": [
      "**Праздновать** («to celebrate») takes its object in the accusative: **Мы празднуем Новый год** («We celebrate New Year»). **В честь** («in honour of») takes the genitive: **в честь праздника** («in honour of the festival»).",
      "**Традиция** («tradition») and **обычай** («custom») are learned words that are used in texts."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What is done",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something is customary, use **принято** + infinitive: **Принято дарить подарки** («It is customary to give presents»).",
      "**Принято** is a short form: it does not change with the subject."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
